flowchart LR
  classDef human fill:#FFF4D6,stroke:#B98422,color:#392D17
  classDef app fill:#E9F1EA,stroke:#4B7659,color:#1C3825
  classDef orchestration fill:#EEEAF8,stroke:#6657A4,color:#30275A
  classDef provider fill:#E7F2F5,stroke:#3F7381,color:#173841
  classDef data fill:#F2F2EC,stroke:#767A71,color:#2D302A
  classDef safety fill:#FBE8E6,stroke:#A9534D,color:#4B211E

  User[Sales operator]:::human --> UI[Lovable React app]:::app
  UI --> Edge[Supabase Auth and Edge Functions]:::app
  Edge --> DB[(Supabase Postgres and RLS)]:::data
  Edge --> Intake[WF01 Account intake]:::orchestration
  Intake --> Research[WF02 Evidence and Fit Agent]:::orchestration
  Research --> Firecrawl[Firecrawl web and PDF]:::provider
  Research --> AccountAgent[Account Intelligence Agent]:::provider
  AccountAgent --> Catalog[Knoxx catalogue tool]:::data
  Research --> Rules[Deterministic scoring and ranges]:::safety
  Rules --> Committee[WF04 Buying Committee Agent]:::orchestration
  Committee --> Apollo[Apollo search and enrichment]:::provider
  Committee --> Outreach[WF05 Outreach Agent]:::orchestration
  Outreach --> Approval{Human approval}:::human
  Approval --> SafeSend[Allowlisted Gmail adapter]:::safety
  SafeSend --> Events[WF06 Engagement controller]:::orchestration
  Events --> StopRules[Idempotent stop rules]:::safety
  StopRules --> DB
  DB --> UI
  Research -.-> Eval[Native n8n Evaluations]:::orchestration
  Committee -.-> Eval
  Outreach -.-> Eval
  Eval --> Judge[Independent Gemini judge]:::provider
